fter ''when'', use the present simple for the future.","sort_order":8},{"id":"CP1-09","week_number":2,"reserve":false,"target":"Main: time clause","prompt":"As soon as the film ___ (finish), we''ll go for dinner.","options":[],"key":"finishes","reason":"After ''as soon as'', use the present simple for the future.","sort_order":9},{"id":"CP1-10","week_number":2,"reserve":false,"target":"Light","prompt":"If I ___ the lottery, I''d buy a house by the sea.","options":["won","win"],"key":"won","reason":"Second conditional: an imagined situation.","sort_order":10},{"id":"CP1-11","week_number":3,"reserve":false,"target":"Main: obligation","prompt":"In the UK, you ___ drive on the left.","options":["have to","don''t have to"],"key":"have to","reason":"It is a rule.","sort_order":11},{"id":"CP1-12","week_number":3,"reserve":false,"target":"Main: advice","prompt":"If you want to improve your English, you ___ read a little every day.","options":["should","mustn''t"],"key":"should","reason":"Advice.","sort_order":12},{"id":"CP1-13","week_number":3,"reserve":false,"target":"Main: ability","prompt":"My grandmother ___ (can / not / use) a smartphone, so we phone her.","options":[],"key":"can''t use (cannot use)","reason":"Ability, negative.","sort_order":13},{"id":"CP1-14","week_number":3,"reserve":false,"target":"Main: permission","prompt":"___ I leave my bag here while I go to the toilet?","options":["Can","Must"],"key":"Can (Could)","reason":"Asking for permission.","sort_order":14},{"id":"CP1-15","week_number":3,"reserve":false,"target":"Light","prompt":"Put the words in order: Where / you / do / work?","options":[],"key":"Where do you work?","reason":"Auxiliary before the subject.","sort_order":15},{"id":"CP1-16","week_number":4,"reserve":false,"target":"Main: present passive","prompt":"Cheese ___ (make) from milk.","options":[],"key":"is made","reason":"A general fact; the cheese is the focus.","sort_order":16},{"id":"CP1-17","week_number":4,"reserve":false,"target":"Main: p